# Billing

## Mục tiêu

Billing system là heart của SaaS monetization, quản lý subscriptions, payments, invoices, và revenue recognition. Trong Cursor Enterprise Framework, billing được thiết kế để support multiple pricing models, flexible plans, usage-based billing, và seamless payment processing. Mục tiêu của rule này là hướng dẫn developers trong việc implement một billing system complete và reliable.

Một billing system tốt cần balance giữa flexibility cho pricing models, reliability cho payment processing, và compliance cho financial transactions. Rule này cover từ subscription management, payment processing, invoice generation, đến revenue reporting.

## Nguyên tắc

**1. Subscription Management**

Support multiple plans. Handle plan changes. Track subscription lifecycle. Manage renewals. Handle cancellations.

**2. Pricing Models**

Support recurring pricing. Implement usage-based. Offer one-time purchases. Create custom pricing. Handle trials.

**3. Payment Processing**

Integrate payment gateways. Handle multiple methods. Manage failed payments. Support refunds. Ensure PCI compliance.

**4. Invoice Generation**

Generate invoices automatically. Support multiple currencies. Include tax calculations. Track payment status. Support invoice templates.

**5. Revenue Recognition**

Track revenue accurately. Support ASC 606. Handle prepaid revenue. Calculate MRR/ARR. Report on revenue.

**6. Dunning Management**

Handle failed payments. Send reminders. Manage retry logic. Escalate issues. Prevent churn.

**7. Usage Tracking**

Track metered usage. Calculate usage charges. Support quota systems. Enable real-time usage. Bill accurately.

**8. Tax Compliance**

Calculate taxes. Support multiple jurisdictions. Handle tax exemptions. Generate tax reports. Ensure compliance.

**9. Customer Self-Service**

Allow plan changes. Enable payment updates. Support upgrade/downgrade. Provide billing history. Enable invoice download.

**10. Financial Reporting**

Track MRR/ARR. Report on churn. Analyze LTV. Forecast revenue. Support audits.

## Checklist

- [ ] Pricing plans configured
- [ ] Subscription management implemented
- [ ] Payment gateway integration
- [ ] Invoice generation set up
- [ ] Dunning workflow configured
- [ ] Usage tracking implemented
- [ ] Tax calculations configured
- [ ] Self-service portal built
- [ ] Reporting system set up
- [ ] Compliance features implemented

## Anti Pattern

**1. Manual Billing**

Manual invoice creation. Human errors. Inconsistent billing. Automate billing processes.

**2. No Trial Management**

No free trial tracking. Unexpected charges. Poor UX. Implement proper trials.

**3. Ignoring Failed Payments**

Lost revenue. Poor collections. Implement dunning. Handle failures gracefully.

**4. No Proration**

Incorrect charges on plan changes. Customer complaints. Implement proration. Handle mid-cycle changes.

**5. Poor Audit Trail**

No billing history. Compliance issues. Difficult debugging. Maintain complete audit trail.

## Best Practice

**1. Subscription Management**

```typescript
// services/subscription.service.ts
export interface Subscription {
  id: string;
  tenantId: string;
  planId: string;
  status: SubscriptionStatus;
  currentPeriodStart: Date;
  currentPeriodEnd: Date;
  cancelAtPeriodEnd: boolean;
  cancelledAt?: Date;
  trialEndsAt?: Date;
  createdAt: Date;
  updatedAt: Date;
}

export enum SubscriptionStatus {
  ACTIVE = 'active',
  PAST_DUE = 'past_due',
  CANCELLED = 'cancelled',
  TRIALING = 'trialing',
  INCOMPLETE = 'incomplete',
  INCOMPLETE_EXPIRED = 'incomplete_expired'
}

export class SubscriptionService {
  constructor(
    private subscriptionRepository: SubscriptionRepository,
    private planService: PlanService,
    private paymentService: PaymentService,
    private invoiceService: InvoiceService,
    private eventBus: EventBus
  ) {}

  async createSubscription(
    tenantId: string,
    planId: string,
    options: {
      trialDays?: number;
      paymentMethodId?: string;
      couponCode?: string;
    } = {}
  ): Promise<Subscription> {
    // Validate plan
    const plan = await this.planService.getPlan(planId);
    if (!plan) {
      throw new NotFoundError('Plan not found');
    }

    // Check for existing subscription
    const existing = await this.subscriptionRepository.findActiveByTenant(tenantId);
    if (existing) {
      throw new ConflictError('Tenant already has an active subscription');
    }

    // Calculate dates
    const now = new Date();
    const trialEnd = options.trialDays 
      ? addDays(now, options.trialDays) 
      : undefined;

    const periodStart = trialEnd || now;
    const periodEnd = addDays(periodStart, plan.billingInterval === 'monthly' ? 30 : 365);

    // Create subscription
    const subscription = await this.subscriptionRepository.create({
      tenantId,
      planId,
      status: trialEnd ? SubscriptionStatus.TRIALING : SubscriptionStatus.ACTIVE,
      currentPeriodStart: now,
      currentPeriodEnd: periodEnd,
      trialEndsAt: trialEnd,
      createdAt: now,
      updatedAt: now
    });

    // Apply coupon if provided
    if (options.couponCode) {
      await this.applyCoupon(subscription.id, options.couponCode);
    }

    // Set payment method if provided
    if (options.paymentMethodId) {
      await this.paymentService.setDefaultPaymentMethod(tenantId, options.paymentMethodId);
    }

    // Generate first invoice if not trialing
    if (!trialEnd) {
      await this.invoiceService.generateInvoice(subscription.id);
    }

    // Publish event
    await this.eventBus.publish(new SubscriptionCreatedEvent(subscription));

    return subscription;
  }

  async changePlan(
    subscriptionId: string,
    newPlanId: string,
    options: {
      prorate?: boolean;
      immediate?: boolean;
    } = {}
  ): Promise<{ subscription: Subscription; invoice?: Invoice }> {
    const subscription = await this.subscriptionRepository.findById(subscriptionId);
    if (!subscription) {
      throw new NotFoundError('Subscription not found');
    }

    const oldPlan = await this.planService.getPlan(subscription.planId);
    const newPlan = await this.planService.getPlan(newPlanId);

    if (!oldPlan || !newPlan) {
      throw new NotFoundError('Plan not found');
    }

    let invoice: Invoice | undefined;

    if (options.prorate) {
      // Calculate proration
      const proration = this.calculateProration(subscription, oldPlan, newPlan);
      
      if (proration !== 0) {
        invoice = await this.invoiceService.generateProrationInvoice(
          subscriptionId,
          proration,
          newPlan
        );
      }
    }

    // Update subscription
    const updated = await this.subscriptionRepository.update(subscriptionId, {
      planId: newPlanId,
      updatedAt: new Date()
    });

    // Publish event
    await this.eventBus.publish(new SubscriptionPlanChangedEvent(
      subscriptionId,
      oldPlan.id,
      newPlan.id
    ));

    return { subscription: updated, invoice };
  }

  async cancelSubscription(
    subscriptionId: string,
    options: {
      cancelAtPeriodEnd?: boolean;
      reason?: string;
    } = {}
  ): Promise<Subscription> {
    const subscription = await this.subscriptionRepository.findById(subscriptionId);
    if (!subscription) {
      throw new NotFoundError('Subscription not found');
    }

    if (options.cancelAtPeriodEnd) {
      // Schedule cancellation
      const updated = await this.subscriptionRepository.update(subscriptionId, {
        cancelAtPeriodEnd: true,
        cancelledAt: new Date(),
        updatedAt: new Date()
      });

      await this.eventBus.publish(new SubscriptionCancellationScheduledEvent(
        subscriptionId,
        subscription.currentPeriodEnd
      ));

      return updated;
    } else {
      // Immediate cancellation with prorated refund
      const refundAmount = this.calculateRefund(subscription);
      
      if (refundAmount > 0) {
        await this.paymentService.processRefund(subscription.tenantId, refundAmount);
      }

      const updated = await this.subscriptionRepository.update(subscriptionId, {
        status: SubscriptionStatus.CANCELLED,
        cancelledAt: new Date(),
        updatedAt: new Date()
      });

      await this.eventBus.publish(new SubscriptionCancelledEvent(
        subscriptionId,
        refundAmount,
        options.reason
      ));

      return updated;
    }
  }

  async reactivateSubscription(subscriptionId: string): Promise<Subscription> {
    const subscription = await this.subscriptionRepository.findById(subscriptionId);
    if (!subscription) {
      throw new NotFoundError('Subscription not found');
    }

    if (subscription.status !== SubscriptionStatus.CANCELLED) {
      throw new ValidationError('Can only reactivate cancelled subscriptions');
    }

    // Check if within grace period
    const gracePeriodDays = 30;
    const gracePeriodEnd = addDays(subscription.cancelledAt, gracePeriodDays);
    
    if (new Date() > gracePeriodEnd) {
      throw new ValidationError('Grace period has expired');
    }

    const updated = await this.subscriptionRepository.update(subscriptionId, {
      status: SubscriptionStatus.ACTIVE,
      cancelAtPeriodEnd: false,
      cancelledAt: null,
      updatedAt: new Date()
    });

    await this.eventBus.publish(new SubscriptionReactivatedEvent(subscriptionId));

    return updated;
  }

  private calculateProration(
    subscription: Subscription,
    oldPlan: Plan,
    newPlan: Plan
  ): number {
    const now = new Date();
    const periodStart = subscription.currentPeriodStart;
    const periodEnd = subscription.currentPeriodEnd;
    const totalDays = differenceInDays(periodEnd, periodStart);
    const daysRemaining = differenceInDays(periodEnd, now);

    const oldPlanDaily = oldPlan.price / totalDays;
    const newPlanDaily = newPlan.price / totalDays;

    // Credit for unused old plan
    const credit = oldPlanDaily * daysRemaining;
    // Charge for remaining new plan
    const charge = newPlanDaily * daysRemaining;

    return charge - credit;
  }

  private calculateRefund(subscription: Subscription): number {
    const now = new Date();
    const periodEnd = subscription.currentPeriodEnd;
    const totalDays = differenceInDays(periodEnd, subscription.currentPeriodStart);
    const daysRemaining = differenceInDays(periodEnd, now);

    const plan = await this.planService.getPlan(subscription.planId);
    const dailyRate = plan.price / totalDays;

    return dailyRate * daysRemaining;
  }
}
